  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Management Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this annual course is to provide civil servants and relevant semi-public organisations working in the field of Water Management, to share their knowledge and skills enabling them to lead and inspire the modernisation of Water Management in their home countries.The course also aims to strengthen participants&apos; ties with the Netherlands and stakeholders in the Dutch water sector.</narrative>
  </description>
